  <constraints>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§7">SCOPE: Project-close 5-part wrap-up ceremony — README status + lessons-learned + repo-cleanup + INDEX.md archival + /test-diet.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§7">SCOPE (BINDING): /test-diet gate — SCAFFOLDING/MAINTAIN classification per ADR-038 §7 17-ban classifier; skip requires explicit rationale in wrap-up PR description.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">SCOPE: /test-diet reclassifies each test added/modified during r1 as scaffolding (delete) OR maintain (keep at KEEP path). Reviewer applies the git rm / git mv commands emitted.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: lessons-learned.md captures r1-specific learnings (Model 1/2, UAMI, canonical naming, GraphAppRoles.cs, tenant-isolation), not generic project retrospective.</constraint>
