  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (STANDARD). Load root CLAUDE.md §7 + task-create Step 3.7 + .claude/skills/repo-cleanup + devops-project-archive + test-diet SKILL.md files.</step>
